{{// The heart of ARIA. It makes the AI your storyteller and game master and keeps every character true to their card: the card's mood and energy hold until the story gives a reason to change, nerves stay nerves, and nobody turns into a polished action hero. Characters get tastes of their own, know only what they saw, heard or were told, and fall in love at a believable pace. Anyone new who wanders into a scene stays at its edge and leaves once their business is done, so the card's characters keep the spotlight. The story stays in whatever language you write in. Leave this ON. Its first line quietly resets ARIA's internal switches every turn, so a module you turn off stays off.}}{{trim}}
